@chapter Fortran Frontend

@cindex Fortran frontend
@cindex Fortran syntax
@cindex Fortran keywords
@cindex Fortran operators
@cindex Fortran VII

This chapter describes the Fortran frontend of the EightBol compiler. The
frontend translates Fortran source code into an abstract syntax tree (AST)
that is subsequently processed by the code generation backends. The
frontend implements a simplified Fortran VII dialect with extensions for
object-oriented programming.

